# Local credentials and machine-specific configuration
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
/config.json
/config.local.json
**/*.local.json
# The runtime file holds real credentials and must stay ignored. Its template is
# settings.local.example.json, which is tracked because it contains no values.
!/ar-runtime/.claude/settings.local.example.json
**/credentials.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/*secret*.json
# This one is named for the scan it feeds, not for what it holds: it lists file
# paths and rule names only, no values. Without the exemption the rule above
# swallows it and the scan runs with no exemptions at all.
!/scripts/secret_scan_allowlist.json
**/*token*.json
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.netrc

# Root Claude state is local. Keep nested agent and skill definitions.
/.claude/
**/.claude/autonomy/
**/.claude/*.local.md

# Cookies, login state, and private remote profiles
**/twitter_cookies.json
**/*cookies*.json
**/*cookie*.json
**/*session*.json
**/scweet_state*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# idea_generation.py runtime output
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/*.jsonl
**/outputs/
**/runs/
**/artifacts/
**/scratch/
/dashboard.html
/index.html
/ideas.html
/dashboard_index.html
/kb_dashboard.html
/trigger_3month.txt
# Inside an ar-coordinator project, ignore what a run leaves behind and keep what
# it produced. An earlier version of this rule ignored /data/projects/* wholesale,
# which also hid the experiment code, the results and the reports -- the things a
# research repository exists to keep. One run directory was 69MB, of which 52K was
# code and the rest a virtualenv.
/data/projects/*/.venv/
/data/projects/*/**/.venv/
/data/projects/*/**/__pycache__/
/data/projects/*/decisions.log
/data/projects/*/notifications.log
/data/projects/*/*.log
/data/projects/*/**/*.log
/data/projects/*/workflow_queue.lock
# 调度器的工作状态：哪个单元 running、租约归谁、抢占计数。跑到一半停下时它记的全是
# 早已失效的东西，跑完了它的信息也已经进了产物。留在仓里只会和别处对不上——仓里这两份
# 就是，一份 20 个单元全终态而 cycle_status 仍是 pending，一份记着 7 个 pending 的活。
/data/projects/*/workflow_queue.json
# 引擎留的队列镜像。run 正常结束时它和 workflow_queue.json 逐字节相同，跟踪它等于把
# 同一份队列存两遍；两份不同就说明队列被第三方重写了，那是要修的状态，不是要提交的。
/data/projects/*/workflow_queue.engine.json
/data/projects/*/.state/

# generated by src/generate_project_dashboard.py; echoes state.md's own
# project_root path, so it carries the same local-path leak state.md avoids
/data/projects/*/dashboard.html

# coordinator 每轮覆写的运行时快照：现在做到哪、哪个 agent 还活着、下一轮做什么。
# 跑到一半停下时它记的是一堆失效 task_id 和 status=alive，clone 的人读到的是这个项目
# 正在跑。结论不归它，归 results/。
/data/projects/*/state.md
# monitor 的心跳状态，每轮都变。跟踪它等于让每个跑过流程的人
# 都拿到一棵脏工作树，而它对新 clone 没有任何价值。
/data/projects/*/results/monitor_state.json

# Generated environments, dependencies, and build output
**/.conda-env/
**/.python-venv/
**/.python-env/
**/.venv/
/.venv-research/
**/venv/
/env/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/.cache/
**/coverage/
**/*.egg-info/

# Python caches and test state
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# Large generated model and data artifacts
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.ckpt
**/*.safetensors

# Local editor and OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp
**/*.suo

# Internal progress reports, not part of the runnable release
/KEY_POINTS_SUMMARY.md
/PROGRESS_REPORT_*.md

# ar-runtime (official Claude Code path, #108): local credentials and run leftovers
/ar-runtime/.claude/settings.local.json
/ar-runtime/.claude/ralph-loop.local.md

# Optional GPT Researcher output must be reviewed before entering knowledge_base/.
/workspaces/knowledge-drafts/

